urepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Nightlife","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"DKtAKuOjI6vUAHhW4NR5UA","review_id":"OB0_xriD5Y36A-5_GAnCWw","date":"2011-03-25T21:33:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9374016523361206,"text_excerpt":"We've been to Mulate's a few times now, and the food is always consistently good. I also like the vibe of this place, which is very family friendly and just plain fun. I love the Zydeco Gumbo and the Crawfish Etouffee, and the bread pudding is excellent. This is a great place to go with a big group and have dinner, then stay for the dancing. It's also away from the Quarter, which can be a real blessing after a few days of the crowds there. Great Cajun food, great Cajun music...what's not to love?"},{"business_id":"DKtAKuOjI6vUAHhW4NR5UA","review_id":"XJbzw13Y_TPZXWPKeV11Qg","date":"2019-01-30T00:32:10","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9367579221725464,"text_excerpt":"This was by far one of our favorite place to eat when we went to New Orleans. We ate there twice because we loved it so much. Let me count the ways in which they are amazing: 1. They have live traditional music. 2. Family friendly. 3. Delicious food (the barbecue shrimp is amazing and there po'boys are served on bread that's made from clouds) 4. Strong drinks. 5. The staff is very friendly. Now excuse me while I try to find a barbecue shrimp recipe on Pinterest that will do Mulate's justice..."},{"business_id":"DKtAKuOjI6vUAHhW4NR5UA","review_id":"-XSNftMlO-jMB1BXIFxn2Q","date":"2020-02-28T03:03:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9365332126617432,"text_excerpt":"This place might not be your vibe, but the food is solid. I came here on a random night and grabbed dinner and was really happy with the results. The blackened alligator was EXCELLENT - easily one of the best meals I had in New Orleans, and that's not an easy feat to pull off. The drinks were meh, but I was happy enough with the food to ignore it. One side note - this place definitely feels like it targets boomer tourists, so it might not be your scene. I might recommend coming here when it's less crowded."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"DKtAKuOjI6vUAHhW4NR5UA","photo_id":"9-EQZNwGBu9PBy5jSOexbw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/9-EQZNwGBu9PBy5jSOexbw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8450572490692139},{"business_id":"DKtAKuOjI6vUAHhW4NR5UA","photo_id":"q2jPVjw18JimHCqC4EitNQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/q2jPVjw18JimHCqC4EitNQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8411673307418823},{"business_id":"DKtAKuOjI6vUAHhW4NR5UA","photo_id":"G9PijFP6uMrb2a5AunZ2eA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/G9PijFP6uMrb2a5AunZ2eA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8081559538841248},{"business_id":"DKtAKuOjI6vUAHhW4NR5UA","photo_id":"cEQ7jiXe0hc8gXz4j9oX-g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/cEQ7jiXe0hc8gXz4j9oX-g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7939863204956055},{"business_id":"DKtAKuOjI6vUAHhW4NR5UA","photo_id":"nROvmf35Y853lYhVNsCF3w","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/nROvmf35Y853lYhVNsCF3w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7772051095962524}]},"notebook_case":null}
